            {
                "comment": "For this class we had online \"prelectures\" (30-75 minutes of videos) and then active learning during the lecture times that were not mandatory. Overall this class and the professor are interesting but quite detailed. Grade based on 3 open note exams, understanding concepts is important and exam questions are complex.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 4
