            {
                "comment": "Good class and I enjoyed her lectures. No real criticism- definitely would have wished to get to know her more. Definitely Recommend her class!",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "A typical lecture class. All the materials can be found online. GRADE BASED ONLY ON EXAMS. Dr. Gumperz is helpful in answering questions and flexible in office hours. She really wants her students to succeed. The class is pretty straight forward.",
