                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Drs. Gumperz, Zumwalde, and Baiu (and Troy) were wonderful instructors, esp after last semester's scandal. Class isn't mandatory, but the medium-difficulty exams are based off the slides and 3 determine your entire grade. No textbook required, discussion optional, and overall loved - this was my favorite and most informative class of the semester.",
